# Local development database
#
# Every sidecar, not just the database. A rollback journal holds the original
# contents of the pages being overwritten and a WAL holds the new ones, so
# either can carry real rows — wallet addresses and trade history — even when
# the .db itself is ignored. The journal was the one missing, and a file of
# that name was tracked.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-journal
backups/
